     ],
     "excerpt": "The current S2 ceiling of 7% keeps the Hearth 10 below the limit while retaining regulator and relevant-customer access and the public-disclosure safeguard. S5’s model-specific 10/100k trigger also avoids applying the proposed threshold to company-wide rates; keep it model-specific and based on verified data.",
